{"productId": "d970441f-c63b-4239-a4a5-567d6fd94fc6", "modelName": "Premier Mountain 2.0", "modelDescription": " The Bergara Mountain 2.0 features a stainless-steel Bergara barrel that goes through additional honing and quality procedures, putting them a step above the rest, and finished with Tactical Grey Cerakote. The Mountain 2.0 action is designed as a two-lug system that features a separate floating bolt head to ensure contact with the lug abutments in the action. It also features a cone-shaped bolt nose for smooth feeding of the cartridge, and a spring-loaded sliding plate extractor located in the front of the lower locking lug. The one-piece bolt body is stainless-steel with a pad at the rear to accept the threaded-in bolt handle. The bolt head, non-rotating gas shield, bolt handle, and bolt shroud are fully Nitrided for extreme durability, as well as its self-lubricating properties.", "manufacturerName": "Bergara", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "2959df5e-7dca-4bfa-9258-05212f315c23", "description": "Bergara, Premier Mountain 2.0, Bolt Action, 308 Winchester, 22\" Barrel, Gray Finish, Camo Carbon Fiber Stock, Right Hand, 4 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/0ece93fe-6369-4692-a4e1-cfa6d6a1f835"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "BPR28-308", "upc": "043125308347", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "21a0479f-f302-434a-9087-61aca6affeac", "valueName": "22\""}, {"attributeNameId": "5978af0e-1de2-4b6e-9b64-b8c25e2e8d70", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "64defbb6-9f52-4413-8f28-3f0231450e4e", "valueName": "308 Winchester"}, {"attributeNameId": "2ec4f4e1-4aed-47a2-bb02-cd7f86849836", "attributeName": "Hand", "attributeValueId": "324e63b7-c8e9-47bd-898b-de0f8eaa7ff6", "valueName": "Right"}, {"attributeNameId": "6de54e07-e352-463c-bf38-3079da1974f9", "attributeNa